OL,3,GNEWSAPM to 'listen carefully' to Linton
OL,4,Aasylum concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said he
OL,7,Fwill "listen carefully" to the
OL,8,F"legitimate concerns" over plans to
OL,9,Fhouse asylum seekers at a former RAF
OL,10,Fbase in North Yorkshire.
OL,12,FThe Home Office is considering using
OL,13,FRAF Linton-on-Ouse to accommodate up to
OL,14,F1,200 asylum seekers, although no final
OL,15,Fdecision has been made.
OL,17,FCounty mayor David Skaith this week
OL,18,Fcalled for a meeting with Home
OL,19,FSecretary Shabana Mahmood over the
OL,20,Fplan, while a police chief raised
OL,21,Fconcerns over force resources.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
